{"seq":62,"slug":"long-context-llm-techniques","title":"长上下文 LLM 技术","stage":"DONE","category":"ai-llm","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/long-context-llm-techniques","rating":{"composite":4.04,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"长上下文-llm-技术-总览\">长上下文 LLM 技术·总览</h1><p>把一份十万字的代码库、一整本财报、上百轮对话历史一次性塞进模型的输入窗口，这是 2024 年以来生成式 AI 最受瞩目、也最容易被误解的能力之一。模型厂商在发布会上反复强调&quot;百万 token 上下文&quot;，但真正的工程师很快发现：能塞进去，不等于读得懂；窗口标到 1M，不等于第 50 万个 token 还被认真对待。这个 hub 要讲清楚的，正是这道鸿沟两侧的全部技术——从注意力为什么天然吃不消长序列，到工业界用哪些手段把窗口撑大、把成本压下、把质量稳住。</p>\n<p>长上下文不是单一技巧，而是一条从理论瓶颈贯穿到生产实践的技术链。本 hub 按四条主线递进组织，每一章都建立在前一章的结论之上。</p>\n<p>第一条主线是<strong>基础</strong>：先把&quot;为什么长上下文困难&quot;这个问题本身讲透——它同时是显存问题、算力问题和质量问题三件事。接着拆解注意力 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 复杂度的来源与 FlashAttention 这类 IO 优化能解决什么、不能解决什么，再回到位置编码，说明 RoPE、ALiBi 这些机制如何决定了一个模型&quot;原生&quot;能看多远。基础章是后面所有扩展手段的共同前提。</p>\n<p>第二条主线是<strong>扩展方法</strong>：当一个只在 4K 上训练过的模型要处理 128K 输入时，工业界靠什么把它&quot;撑大&quot;。位置插值、NTK-aware、YaRN 这一族 RoPE 缩放手段是最主流的路径；稀疏与局部注意力从另一个方向降低复杂度；而真正稳定的长度外推往往离不开一轮长度课程的继续预训练与微调。这三者常被组合使用。</p>\n<p>第三条主线是<strong>推理系统</strong>：窗口撑大之后，KV 缓存会成倍膨胀，成为真正的部署瓶颈。这一章讲 KV 缓存压缩（驱逐与量化）、分页与流式注意力（PagedAttention、StreamingLLM 的注意力汇聚点），以及一个绕不开的架构抉择——检索（RAG）与长上下文之间该怎么取舍。</p>\n<p>第四条主线是<strong>实践</strong>：用大海捞针、RULER、NoLiMa 这些评测把厂商宣称的窗口&quot;祛魅&quot;，直面&quot;中间遗失&quot;与&quot;上下文腐烂&quot;这两类系统性失效，最后落到 2026 年百万 token 前沿的真实格局——谁真能用、代价是什么。</p>\n<p><strong>与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</strong>。本 hub 聚焦&quot;如何让 Transformer 看得更长、读得更准&quot;。如果你关心的是<strong>用一种根本不同的架构</strong>绕开二次复杂度，请去 <a href=\"../state-space-models-mamba/\">状态空间模型与 Mamba</a>——那里讲 SSM 的线性复杂度递归路线；本 hub 只在稀疏注意力一章一句话点到它。如果你关心的是<strong>推理服务的工程系统</strong>——连续批处理、调度、自动扩缩容、多租户，请去 <a href=\"../llm-serving-inference-systems/\">LLM 推理服务系统</a>；本 hub 的推理系统章只取其中与长上下文直接相关的 KV 与分页部分，不展开通用 serving。模型压缩、量化、蒸馏的通用理论在 <a href=\"../model-compression-inference/\">模型压缩与推理优化</a>，本 hub 只谈 KV 缓存这一类专属于长序列的压缩。检索系统的向量库、分块、混合检索细节在 <a href=\"../rag-knowledge-systems/\">RAG 与知识系统</a>，本 hub 只在取舍一章讨论&quot;何时选 RAG、何时选长上下文&quot;的决策。</p>\n<p><strong>推荐学习路径</strong>。初次接触者建议严格顺读：基础三篇→扩展三篇→推理三篇→实践三篇，这条线索是层层递进的。已有 Transformer 基础、只想解决具体问题的工程师，可以直接从扩展方法或推理系统切入，遇到不熟的概念再回基础章按交叉链接补。做评测与选型的同学可以先读实践章的评测与上下文腐烂两篇，它们会把&quot;窗口大小&quot;这个营销指标还原成可验证的工程事实。</p>\n<p><strong>前置知识</strong>。阅读本 hub 需要理解 Transformer 与自注意力的基本结构（见 <a href=\"../llm-fundamentals/foundations/transformer-architecture\">Transformer 架构</a> 与 <a href=\"../llm-fundamentals/foundations/attention-mechanism\">注意力机制</a>），了解 KV 缓存在自回归解码中的作用，并对显存与算力的数量级有直觉。不需要你能手推所有公式，但需要你能分辨&quot;标称窗口&quot;与&quot;有效窗口&quot;的差别——这正是本 hub 想交给你的核心判断力。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/long-context-llm-techniques/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-context-is-hard","title":"长上下文为何困难","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/long-context-llm-techniques/foundations/why-context-is-hard"},{"seq":2,"slug":"attention-complexity","title":"注意力复杂度与瓶颈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/long-context-llm-techniques/foundations/attention-complexity"},{"seq":3,"slug":"positional-encoding-basics","title":"位置编码基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/long-context-llm-techniques/foundations/positional-encoding-basics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"extension-methods","title":"扩展方法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/long-context-llm-techniques/extension-methods","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rope-scaling","title":"RoPE 缩放","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/long-context-llm-techniques/extension-methods/rope-scaling"},{"seq":2,"slug":"sparse-local-attention","title":"稀疏与局部注意力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/long-context-llm-techniques/extension-methods/sparse-local-attention"},{"seq":3,"slug":"context-extension-finetuning","title":"长度外推与微调","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/long-context-llm-techniques/extension-methods/context-extension-finetuning"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"inference-systems","title":"推理系统","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/long-context-llm-techniques/inference-systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"kv-cache-compression","title":"KV 缓存压缩","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/long-context-llm-techniques/inference-systems/kv-cache-compression"},{"seq":2,"slug":"paged-streaming-attention","title":"分页与流式注意力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/long-context-llm-techniques/inference-systems/paged-streaming-attention"},{"seq":3,"slug":"retrieval-vs-long-context","title":"检索与长上下文取舍","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/long-context-llm-techniques/inference-systems/retrieval-vs-long-context"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/long-context-llm-techniques/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"long-context-evaluation","title":"长上下文评测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/long-context-llm-techniques/practice/long-context-evaluation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"context-rot-failures","title":"中间遗失与上下文腐烂","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/long-context-llm-techniques/practice/context-rot-failures"},{"seq":3,"slug":"frontier-million-token","title":"百万 token 前沿","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/long-context-llm-techniques/practice/frontier-million-token"}]}]}